		{"id":"doc-uiux","type":"file","file":"secure-bulletin-board/docs/02_UI_UX설계.md","x":0,"y":1540,"width":400,"height":340},
		{"id":"arch-view","type":"text","text":"**Thymeleaf View**\nth:text 자동 이스케이프\n(XSS 방어)","x":1440,"y":560,"width":280,"height":100},
		{"id":"doc-ai3","type":"file","file":"secure-bulletin-board/AI_3줄.md","x":0,"y":520,"width":300,"height":200},
		{"id":"erd-users","type":"text","text":"### users\n\n| 컬럼 | 타입 | 제약 |\n|---|---|---|\n| id | BIGINT | PK |\n| username | VARCHAR(50) | UNIQUE, NOT NULL |\n| password | VARCHAR(100) | NOT NULL (BCrypt 해시) |\n| email | VARCHAR(100) | UNIQUE, NOT NULL |\n| created_at | TIMESTAMP | NOT NULL |\n| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | NOT NULL |","x":20,"y":980,"width":400,"height":360},
		{"id":"doc-backend","type":"file","file":"secure-bulletin-board/docs/03_백엔드구조.md","x":460,"y":1540,"width":400,"height":340},
		{"id":"doc-postman","type":"file","file":"secure-bulletin-board/docs/04_API테스트_Postman.md","x":920,"y":1540,"width":400,"height":340},
		{"id":"erd-posts","type":"text","text":"### posts\n\n| 컬럼 | 타입 | 제약 |\n|---|---|---|\n| id | BIGINT | PK |\n| user_id | BIGINT | FK → users.id |\n| title | VARCHAR(200) | NOT NULL |\n| content | TEXT | NOT NULL |\n| created_at | TIMESTAMP | NOT NULL |\n| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | NOT NULL |","x":480,"y":980,"width":400,"height":360},
		{"id":"arch-secchain","type":"text","text":"🔐 **Spring Security Filter Chain**\nCSRF 검증 → 인증(Authentication) → 인가(Authorization)\n\n통과한 요청만 다음 단계로 전달","x":1750,"y":140,"width":520,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arch-service","type":"text","text":"**Service**\n비즈니스 로직\n작성자 본인 확인 (이중 방어)","x":1810,"y":350,"width":280,"height":120},
		{"id":"arch-db","type":"text","text":"**DB**\nH2 인메모리 (로컬 전용)\n재시작하면 데이터 초기화","x":2180,"y":560,"width":280,"height":100},
		{"id":"arch-browser","type":"text","text":"🌐 **Browser**\nHTTP 요청 (폼 제출 · CSRF 토큰 포함)","x":1850,"y":-40,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"arch-repo","type":"text","text":"**Repository**\nSpring Data JPA\n파라미터 바인딩만 사용","x":2180,"y":350,"width":280,"height":120},
		{"id":"road-w0","type":"text","text":"**0주차 — 기획** ✅ 완료\n- 원본 지시서 검토\n- 프로젝트 폴더·문서 세트 생성\n- docs/01_기획.md 작성 (12섹션)","x":1440,"y":1030,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"road-w1","type":"text","text":"**1주차 — 기반 + 인증** ✅ 완료\n- Gradle 9.5.1 / Spring Boot 3.5.6\n- H2(인메모리) 연동\n- users 테이블 설계\n- 회원가입/로그인 + 세션 인증\n- ~~React(Vite) 초기화~~ → 이후 제거\n  (Thymeleaf 단일 스택으로 확정)\n- 테스트 10건 전부 통과","x":1900,"y":1030,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"road-w2","type":"text","text":"**2주차 — 게시글 CRUD** ✅ 완료\n- posts 테이블 설계 (1:N, 단방향)\n- 목록(페이징)/상세/작성/수정/삭제\n- Bean Validation\n- 작성자 본인 검증 → 타인 글 403\n- XSS 이스케이프 확인\n- 테스트 누적 31건 통과","x":2360,"y":1030,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"road-w3","type":"text","text":"**3주차 — Security 통합** ✅ 완료\n- SecurityConfig 적용\n- @PreAuthorize + Service 소유자 검증\n  (인가 3중 방어)\n- 로그아웃 · 세션 고정 방지 검증 완료","x":2820,"y":1030,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"road-w4","type":"text","text":"**4주차 — 보안 강화 + 마무리**\n✅ BCrypt/XSS/CSRF/SQLi 확인\n✅ JUnit 36건 · Postman 39단언 통과\n✅ OWASP ZAP: High 0 · Low 0\n✅ CSP · SameSite · HttpOnly 적용\n⬜ 배포 — 하지 않음\n  (무료 Java 호스트가 카드 요구)","x":3280,"y":1030,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"}
	],
